<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span><span id="A1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span>: Supplementary Materials</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Statistical Details</span>.
In this section, we provide more fine-grained statistics of <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span>, which supplements analysis in Section <a href="#S4.SS4" title="4.4. Benchmark Statistics ‣ 4. M4DocBench Benchmark ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a>.
In Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A M4DocBench: Supplementary Materials ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we report the statistical details about multimodal documents in <span id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span>. Note that documents of all domains contain considerable figures and tables.
In Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix A M4DocBench: Supplementary Materials ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, we provide more fine-grained statistics of <span id="A1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span> by domains as well as statistics of question, document, evidence, answer, etc.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Annotation Demonstration</span>.
Although Figure <a href="#S1.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> shows a typical annotation of <span id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span>, we provide two more annotation examples as shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix A M4DocBench: Supplementary Materials ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. This is to facilitate readers’ understanding on <span id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M4DocBench</span> and its annotation process in Section <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3. Annotation Process ‣ 4. M4DocBench Benchmark ‣ Doc-Researcher: A Unified System for Multimodal Document Parsing and Deep Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
